### skill.md  [instructions]
- name: douyin-scraper
-   Search Douyin (抖音) by natural language query and extract video results.
-   Supports keyword search, trending content, and video detail extraction
-   via browser automation against douyin.com.
- # Douyin Scraper
- > Search Douyin like a human: just say what you want to find.
- ## What This Skill Does
- - **Natural language search** — type "搜索一下海鲜视频" and get results
- - **Keyword search** on douyin.com search page
- - **Extract video metadata** — title, author, stats, cover image
- - **Trending discovery** — browse the Douyin hot/recommend feed
- ## What This Skill Does NOT Do
- - Download video files (use `douyin-downloader` skill)
- - Post or publish content
- - Analyze script quality (use the `douyin` skill)
- - Bypass login walls or anti-scrape measures
- ## Prerequisites
- - `agent-browser` CLI installed and Chromium available
- - Network access to `douyin.com`
- ## Quick Start
- ### Search by natural language
- ```bash
- ```bash
- ```bash
- ```bash
- ```bash
- ```bash
- # Open Douyin search
- agent-browser open "https://www.douyin.com/search/海鲜视频"
- agent-browser wait --load networkidle
- agent-browser wait --load networkidle
- agent-browser snapshot -i -c
- agent-browser snapshot -i -c
- ### Extract results
- After the search page loads, snapshot the results and extract video cards:
- agent-browser snapshot -i -c -d 4
- agent-browser snapshot -i -c -d 4
- Each video card typically contains: title, author name, like count, and a
- thumbnail link. Use `agent-browser get text @eN` to read specific elements.
- ### Open a specific video
- agent-browser click @eN          # click the video card
- ## Search Patterns
- | Intent | URL Pattern |
- |---|---|
- | Keyword search | `https://www.douyin.com/search/{keyword}` |
- | User profile | `https://www.douyin.com/user/{uid}` |
- | Hot/trending | `https://www.douyin.com/hot` |
- | Specific video | `https://www.douyin.com/video/{vid}` |
- URL-encode Chinese keywords for the URL (the browser handles this, but
- if constructing manually use `encodeURIComponent`).
- ## Execution Protocol (for AI agents)
- ### Step 1: Parse the search intent
- Extract the core search query from natural language:
- - "搜索一下海鲜视频" → keyword: `海鲜视频`
- - "帮我找做菜的视频" → keyword: `做菜`
- - "抖音上最近火的" → use trending page
- ### Step 2: Navigate to search
- agent-browser open "https://www.douyin.com/search/{keyword}"
- agent-browser wait --load networkidle --timeout 8000
- ### Step 3: Extract results
- Read video card titles, authors, and stats from the snapshot. If the
- page requires login or shows a wall, report that to the user.
- ### Step 4: Summarize
- Return a structured summary of the top results:
- 🔍 抖音搜索: {keyword}
- ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
- 1. {title} — @{author} ❤️{likes}
- 2. {title} — @{author} ❤️{likes}
- 3. ...
- ### Step 5: Cleanup
- agent-browser close
- ## Troubleshooting
- - **Login wall**: Douyin may require login for some searches. If you hit a
-   login popup, close it or report the limitation.
- - **Empty results**: The keyword may be too specific; try broader terms.
- - **Slow load**: Use `--timeout 10000` on the wait command.
- - **Anti-bot**: If you get blocked, wait a minute and retry. Don't hammer
-   the endpoint.
- ## Activation Rules (for AI agents)
- ### Use this skill when the user asks to:
- - Search Douyin for videos by keyword
- - Find content on 抖音
- - Look up trending Douyin videos
- - "搜索一下..." on Douyin
- ### Do NOT use this skill when:
- - The user wants script analysis (→ `douyin` skill)
- - The user wants to download videos (→ `douyin-downloader` skill)
- - The user wants to post content (→ `douyin-publish` skill)
