+ # Douyin — Search & Scrape + Script Analysis
+ > Search Douyin like a human, get structured results.
+ ## Capabilities
+ 1. **Natural-language search** — type a query like "海鲜视频" and get back video titles, authors, stats, and links.
+ 2. **Script analysis** (legacy) — diagnose hooks, retention, and rebuild pacing.
+ ## How to Search Douyin
+ ### Step 1: Open Douyin search page
+ Use the **browser** tool:
+ ```
+ ```
+ action: open
+ action: open
+ url: https://www.douyin.com/search/搜索关键词
+ Replace `搜索关键词` with the URL-encoded query. For example, to search "海鲜视频":
+ url: https://www.douyin.com/search/%E6%B5%B7%E9%B2%9C%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91
+ ### Step 2: Wait for results and snapshot
+ After the page loads, take a snapshot:
+ action: snapshot
+ refs: aria
+ ### Step 3: Extract results from snapshot
+ Look for video result elements in the accessibility tree. Each result typically contains:
+ - **Title** — the video caption
+ - **Author** — creator name
+ - **Stats** — likes, comments, shares
+ - **Link** — the video URL (href)
+ ### Step 4: Return structured results
+ Format the extracted data as:
+ 🔍 搜索结果: "查询词"
+ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
